{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/a8f3ccdf6d3bc64d0ab0ce5a0d1aea69.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each match, craft your <strong>Loadout</strong> by selecting a unique mix of units, structures, and upgrades. Your choices define your entire strategy \u2014 no tech trees, no mid-match unlocks beyond what you brought. Plan ahead, commit, and execute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/9a166dd9f07c9ed4e0fcd75e42ffa51e.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cubic Annihilation</i> delivers tight, fast-paced RTS gameplay. Control your forces in real time and make every decision count. There\u2019s no room for macro spam \u2014 only quick thinking, smart positioning, and pure tactical execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/07734bdbeb6f1664eac5379555ecc277.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Land, Sea, and Air Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate all domains of battle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ground</strong> units form the backbone \u2014 versatile and essential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Air</strong> units offer mobility and pressure \u2014 perfect for flanking or surgical strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea</strong> units dominate aquatic maps with powerful long-range firepower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master combined-arms warfare or specialize to overwhelm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/7194c9487fca9ef61d3352b6fe939ad5.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Showdowns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against other players in 1v1 or team-based multiplayer battles. Test your strategies, refine your loadouts, and stay sharp \u2014 every match brings something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in <strong>Ranked Mode</strong> and climb the global ladder. Wins push you forward, losses force you to learn. Only consistent, well-rounded commanders will rise to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Command?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cubic Annihilation</i> is a clean, tactical RTS with no fluff. Massive army variety. Brutal decision-making.<br>Choose your loadout. Upgrade your units. Spend your resources \u2014 and outplay everyone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397060?t=1759381383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/b2bdd15ec2de2a1cc8395cd22e2a908cc85c118b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759381383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/157620043a421b57b8e0755c59a065049882cc5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759381383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/157620043a421b57b8e0755c59a065049882cc5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759381383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3955790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo coming in Oct 14 steam fest.</p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is still in development! So some things are still changing and not final.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadmap</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New loadout units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom game settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Game Stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More loadout units, buildings, supaweapons &amp; more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Commanders with different abilities and quirks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifiers for some loadout Units, Buildings, &amp; Commanders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polishing game mechanics and visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a whole lot for stuff.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/a8f3ccdf6d3bc64d0ab0ce5a0d1aea69.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each match, craft your <strong>Loadout</strong> by selecting a unique mix of units, structures, and upgrades. Your choices define your entire strategy \u2014 no tech trees, no mid-match unlocks beyond what you brought. Plan ahead, commit, and execute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/9a166dd9f07c9ed4e0fcd75e42ffa51e.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cubic Annihilation</i> delivers tight, fast-paced RTS gameplay. Control your forces in real time and make every decision count. There\u2019s no room for macro spam \u2014 only quick thinking, smart positioning, and pure tactical execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/07734bdbeb6f1664eac5379555ecc277.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Land, Sea, and Air Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate all domains of battle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ground</strong> units form the backbone \u2014 versatile and essential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Air</strong> units offer mobility and pressure \u2014 perfect for flanking or surgical strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea</strong> units dominate aquatic maps with powerful long-range firepower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master combined-arms warfare or specialize to overwhelm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/7194c9487fca9ef61d3352b6fe939ad5.avif?t=1759381383\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Showdowns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against other players in 1v1 or team-based multiplayer battles. Test your strategies, refine your loadouts, and stay sharp \u2014 every match brings something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in <strong>Ranked Mode</strong> and climb the global ladder. Wins push you forward, losses force you to learn. Only consistent, well-rounded commanders will rise to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Command?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cubic Annihilation</i> is a clean, tactical RTS with no fluff. Massive army variety. Brutal decision-making.<br>Choose your loadout. Upgrade your units. Spend your resources \u2014 and outplay everyone.</p>","developers":["John Corneloup"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/68609238b7e06fce38f1c6c1e31eef7f173273d2/header.jpg?t=1759381383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (Intel Only if no native support)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU (e.g. M1 GPU or Intel Iris)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs well on entry-level Apple Silicon and older Intel Macs</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or better (Universal build preferred)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li